    <string name="anim_gravity_hint">Shake the phone on the home screen: icons and widgets fall into a pile, and tilting the phone tips them over. Grab and throw icons, tap one to open it. Shake again or go home to put everything back.</string>
    <string name="anim_volume">Volume panel</string>
    <string name="anim_volume_ios">An iPhone-style panel: a glass capsule at the edge. It springs in, twitches on every press and shrinks to a thin line after a second; drag it to change the volume, and it stretches like rubber at either end. The ringer mode and other streams aren\'t here — they\'re in the shade.</string>
