    <string name="glass_blur_module_hint">Nothing turned window blur off on this model. The switch installs a tiny Magisk module that turns it back on (ro.surface_flinger.supports_background_blur=1). Takes effect after a reboot, and so does turning it off. Blur puts a little load on the GPU.</string>
    <string name="glass_sliders_hint">Pull down the shade → pencil → add the Brightness and Volume tiles (derealization). They become 1×2 sliders you can move like any tile. While Brightness is there, the regular brightness slider is hidden.</string>
